%N A398892 Site percolation series for square lattice with knight connected sites: coefficients of the power series expansion in powers of q=1-p of the probability that a given site (not assumed to be open) belongs to the infinite cluster, where p is the probability that a site is open.
%H A398892 <a href="/index/Per#percolation">Index entries for sequences related to percolation series</a>.
%F A398892 a(n) = -Sum_{m>=1,k=max(A398889(m),n-m)..min(n,6*m+2)} A398887(m,k)*m*(-1)^(n-k)*binomial(m,n-k) for n >= 2.
%F A398892 a(n) = A398893(n)-A398893(n-1) for n >= 1.
